---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'sw';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Miradi na Kupanga Kazi — Kufuatilia Kazi, Karatasi za Saa, Gharama za Mradi"
  description="Rejista ya miradi, usimamizi wa kazi, ugawaji wa rasilimali, karatasi za saa, bajeti na bili za miradi. Kraal Code ERP."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/sw/uwezo/miradi/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm"><div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Njia ya mkate"><ol><li><a href="/sw/">Nyumbani</a></li><li><a href="/sw/uwezo/">Uwezo</a></li><li aria-current="page">Miradi na Kupanga Kazi</li></ol></nav>
    <h1>Miradi na Kupanga Kazi</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-subtext">Fuatilia miradi kutoka mwanzo hadi mwisho. Panga rasilimali, rekodi saa, simamia bajeti na tengeneza ripoti za faida kwa mradi.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Kwa nani moduli hii</h2>
    <p>Wakurugenzi wa miradi, viongozi wa timu, washauri na viongozi wanaotoa kazi kwa msingi wa mradi. Iwe unashughulikia miradi ya ujenzi, kazi za ushauri, programu zinazofadhiliwa na wafadhili au miradi ya ndani, moduli hii inaendeleza miradi kwa wakati na bajeti.</p>
    <p>Kama kazi yako inagawanywa katika miradi — na unahitaji kujua gharama, muda na faida ya kila mradi — moduli hii ndiyo injini yako.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container">
    <h2>Unachoweza kufanya</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Rejista ya Miradi</h3><p>Tengeneza miradi na tarehe za kuanza/kumaliza, bajeti, wasimamizi na marejeleo ya wateja. Fuatilia hali kutoka mwanzo hadi mwisho.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Usimamizi wa Kazi</h3><p>Gawanya miradi katika kazi na kazi ndogo. Panga majukumu. Weka tarehe za mwisho na utegemezi. Fuatilia hali ya kukamilika.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Ugawaji wa Rasilimali</h3><p>Panga wanatimu kwa miradi na kazi. Fuatilia asilimia za ugawaji. Tambua rasilimali zilizopita kiasi. Linganisha mzigo wa kazi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Karatasi za Saa</h3><p>Rekodi saa zilizotumika kwa miradi na kazi. Idhinisha karatasi za saa kupitia mzunguko wa uidhinishaji. Tumia kwa bili na gharama za miradi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Bajeti za Miradi</h3><p>Bajeti kwa kategoria (kazi, malighafi, gharama). Fuatilia kilichopatikana dhidi ya bajeti na uchambuzi wa tofauti. Tahadhari karibu na vikomo vya bajeti.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Bili za Miradi</h3><p>Tengeneza ankara za wateja kutoka karatasi za saa na hatua. Mifano ya bei ya gorofa na saa zilizotumika. Fuatilia kiasi kilichotozwa dhidi ya kisichotozwa.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Ufuatiliaji wa Hatua</h3><p>Fuatilia hatua muhimu na tarehe za mwisho. Tahadhari za otomatiki unapokaribia au kuvuka tarehe. Ripoti ya maendeleo kwa wateja na wakurugenzi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Ripoti za Mradi</h3><p>Uchambuzi wa gharama na mapato kwa mradi. Linganisha bajeti na halisi. Ripoti za faida kwa mradi, mteja au kipindi.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Jinsi moduli zinavyoungana</h2>
    <p>Moduli ya miradi inaunganisha rasilimali na fedha:</p>
    <ul class="connection-list">
      <li><strong>Uhasibu</strong> → gharama za miradi zinakusanywa na mapato yanatambuliwa kwenye kitabu kikuu</li>
      <li><strong>HR na Mishahara</strong> → karatasi za saa zinaweza kutumika kwa bili na ugawaji wa gharama</li>
      <li><strong>Mauzo</strong> → ankara za mradi zinaweza kutengenezwa kutoka karatasi za saa na hatua</li>
      <li><strong>Manunuzi</strong> → gharama za ununuzi zinaweza kugawiwa kwa miradi</li>
    </ul>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Udhibiti na ruhusa</h2>
    <div class="controls-grid">
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Uidhinishaji wa Karatasi za Saa</h3><p>Karatasi za saa zinahitaji uidhinishaji kabla ya kutumika kwa bili au gharama. Mzunguko wa uidhinishaji unaweza kubadilishwa.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Vikomo vya Bajeti</h3><p>Tahadhari za otomatiki unapokaribia vikomo vya bajeti. Uidhinishaji wa ziada unahitajika kuzuka kikomo.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Njia ya Ukaguzi</h3><p>Kila mabadiliko ya mradi yanarekodiwa: nani, lini, na nini kilibadilishwa. INSERT-tu, halibadiliki.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Ruhusa za Mradi</h3><p>Ruhusa tofauti za kuunda mradi, kusimamia kazi, kuingia saa na kuidhinisha bili. Udhibiti kwa mradi.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <h2>Ona kwa macho</h2>
    <p class="screenshot-intro">Picha kutoka mfumo halisi wa Kraal Code — inakuja hivi karibuni.</p>
    <div class="screenshot-grid">
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Rejista ya Miradi</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Usimamizi wa Kazi</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Karatasi za Saa</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Ripoti za Miradi</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section--dark section"><div class="container text-center">
    <h2>Ona miradi kwa vitendo</h2><p>Oma onyesho lililobinafsishwa kwa mahitaji yako ya usimamizi wa miradi.</p>
    <a href="/sw/mawasiliano/" class="btn btn--inverse">Oma Onyesho →</a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero{padding:var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12)}.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-4xl);max-width:700px}.page-hero-subtext{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);max-width:60ch;margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.breadcrumb ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;gap:var(--kc-space-2);font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.breadcrumb a{color:var(--kc-teal);text-decoration:none}.breadcrumb li:not(:last-child)::after{content:'/';margin-left:var(--kc-space-2);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.container--narrow{max-width:var(--kc-container-narrow)}.container--narrow p{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);line-height:var(--kc-leading-relaxed);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-4)}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-8)}.feature-card{padding:var(--kc-space-6);background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:1px solid var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg)}.feature-card h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-2)}.feature-card p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.connection-list{margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.connection-list li{margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-3);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.connection-list strong{color:var(--kc-text-primary)}.controls-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.control-item{padding:var(--kc-space-5);border-left:3px solid var(--kc-teal)}.control-item h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-1)}.control-item p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.screenshot-intro{color:var(--kc-text-secondary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.screenshot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6)}.screenshot-slot{aspect-ratio:16/10}.screenshot-placeholder{width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:2px dashed var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);gap:var(--kc-space-2)}.screenshot-label{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);color:var(--kc-text-primary)}.screenshot-note{font-size:var(--kc-text-xs);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.btn--inverse{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);background:transparent;color:var(--kc-text-inverse);border:2px solid var(--kc-teal-light);transition:all var(--kc-transition-fast);text-decoration:none;margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.btn--inverse:hover{background:var(--kc-teal);border-color:var(--kc-teal)}@media(max-width:768px){.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-3xl)}.feature-grid,.controls-grid,.screenshot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
